  "description": "<p data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"810\">Vier de geschiedenis van Mario met <strong data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"288\">Super Mario 3D All-Stars</strong>, een <strong data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"324\">3D platformgame-compilatie</strong> die drie legendarische avonturen bundelt: <em data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"383\">Super Mario 64</em>, <em data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"407\">Super Mario Sunshine</em> en <em data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"431\">Super Mario Galaxy</em>. Elk spel is grafisch verbeterd, geoptimaliseerd voor de Nintendo Switch en voorzien van moderne besturing, terwijl de originele charme behouden blijft.<br data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"587\">Beleef tientallen uren avontuur, ontdek nostalgische werelden en geniet van drie tijdloze klassiekers in één collectie. Deze Nintendo Switch-versie verkeert <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"762\">In Nette Staat</strong> en wordt geleverd met het <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"809\">originele hoesje</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"833\">🎮 Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"888\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"872\">Drie legendarische Mario-games</strong> in één bundel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"959\">🕹️ Volledig speelbaar op Nintendo Switch met verbeterde besturing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1015\">🌍 Ontdek werelden uit <em data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"989\">64</em>, <em data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1001\">Sunshine</em> en <em data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1013\">Galaxy</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1069\">🎧 Inclusief muziekmode met iconische soundtracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1107\">📦 Inclusief <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1105\">origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1133\">📋 Specificaties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1444\"><strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1147\">Platform:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1167\">Nintendo Switch</strong><br data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1180\">Titel:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1209\">Super Mario 3D All-Stars</strong><br data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1222\">Genre:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1261\">3D platform / Avontuur / Collectie</strong><br data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1264\"><strong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1273\">Taal:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1314\">Meertalig (o.a. Nederlands & Engels)</strong><br data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1317\"><strong data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1329\">Spelers:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1369\" data-is-only-node=\"\">1–2 spelers (afhankelijk van titel)</strong><br data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1372\"><strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1385\">Conditie:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1404\">In Nette Staat</strong><br data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1407\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1421\">Inclusief:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1442\">Origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1449\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1478\"><strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1478\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand</strong></p>",
